{"steam_appid":3110370,"steam_name":"Dustwind: Resistance","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3110370/604979777/fcaa7897515df36f6f6d5cd403380935706ccb82/1750823735/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749568298","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154859/4fa8678025ddccba8df168ad57330dd6476dc02f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749568298","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/dc32e9b61a921e6a137cccbc47f651821cd9ea26/ss_dc32e9b61a921e6a137cccbc47f651821cd9ea26.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783685656","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/f052abe57e98768f89a8356eb17797b3f4169210/ss_f052abe57e98768f89a8356eb17797b3f4169210.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783685656","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/d2c7985cf8de5011a976b49a27b7965580f20c46/ss_d2c7985cf8de5011a976b49a27b7965580f20c46.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783685656","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/1f9a37c4b7374893d4c3188947d7d4d43c12acc6/ss_1f9a37c4b7374893d4c3188947d7d4d43c12acc6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783685656","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/e3c79411a78c624ef3e95401208008460a8bd19f/ss_e3c79411a78c624ef3e95401208008460a8bd19f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783685656"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dustwind: Resistance is a tactical single-player game set in a post-apocalyptic world, blending real-time combat with the ability to pause and plan. Lead a small squad against an invading army, make hard tactical decisions, and do whatever it takes to protect your people and your way of life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAD THE RESISTANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/028c0c67b2b032dc29298f5ee6e110f8.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/028c0c67b2b032dc29298f5ee6e110f8.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/028c0c67b2b032dc29298f5ee6e110f8.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of Jake, his squad, and his loyal dog, Diesel. Reclaim your homeland and teach the raiders a final lesson. For freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PAUSE, PLAN, ACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/396a6c64c996fcb9f68aff1317733efa.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/396a6c64c996fcb9f68aff1317733efa.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/396a6c64c996fcb9f68aff1317733efa.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat unfolds in real time, but you can pause the game at any moment to issue orders, turning chaos into control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR TACTICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8b76b011f64953474cc7929cb968cbc6.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8b76b011f64953474cc7929cb968cbc6.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8b76b011f64953474cc7929cb968cbc6.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brute force, stealth, positioning, timing, aiming for body parts. How you fight is up to you. Choose wisely, because the enemy is no fool, and a single mistake can spell your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHAPE YOUR CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8cffce6e1b0aa85c909fb11366113fd4.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8cffce6e1b0aa85c909fb11366113fd4.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/8cffce6e1b0aa85c909fb11366113fd4.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your squad with a revamped character system. Choose the best skills and gear to fit your preferred tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE EVERY TOOL OF WAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/2c2cb05936ef188a17844db295156464.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/2c2cb05936ef188a17844db295156464.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/2c2cb05936ef188a17844db295156464.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, chop, kick, or bite. Set traps, throw grenades, deploy turrets and barricades, or crush enemies with an armored car. So many ways to kill. So many ways to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE YOUR OWN BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/6daccfbef50383cd2bdad0c11ad94b05.poster.avif?t=1783685656\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/6daccfbef50383cd2bdad0c11ad94b05.webm?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3110370/extras/6daccfbef50383cd2bdad0c11ad94b05.mp4?t=1783685656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build custom maps and campaigns with the built-in map editor and share them directly to Steam Workshop to keep the fight going.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia 1060 and higher or similar</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","RPG","Strategy"],"developers":["Dustwind Studios","Z-Software"],"publishers":["Z-Software GmbH"],"release_date":"Jun 18, 2025"}